<title>FRANCE: S&amp;P cuts France Telecom long-term debt rating.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P cuts France Telecom long-term debt rating.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard and Poor's said on Monday that it had cut its rating for long-term debt issued by France Telecom to AA plus from AAA.</p>
<p>In a statement the rating agency also said it had revised its outlook on France Telecom to stable from negative.</p>
<p>S&amp;P said it had not changed its A1 plus rating for short-term France Telecom debt.</p>
<p>The decision came after a review of the European telecommunications sector, the statement said.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
